# Alt+Enter (the fullscreen key, port/host/menu.cpp) on the intro is not Start (port/host/input.cpp): Alt down, Enter
# with Alt, Alt let go first, then the held Enter repeating without Alt, then let go. tests/host_checks.sh: the run
# ends as the same run with no keys does. (A hidden window stays windowed.)
10 key_down Left Alt
10 key_down Return | alt
12 key_up Left Alt
14 key_down Return | repeat
16 key_down Return | repeat
18 key_up Return
